TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Övünmek istemem{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama benim {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} epey
meşhurdur. {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bir gün aile yadigârı
olmasını isterim.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Io adoooro il programma "La cena
in 10 secondi"{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} e non vedo l'ora
di guardare la prossima puntata!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Insegneranno come preparare{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:0013:0000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Cucinare è un'arte, dai retta a me!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ti dispiace{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} se mi vanto un po'{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
della mia spettacolare cucina?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Per me la cucina{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} è la stanza più
importante del mio pied-à-terre!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Il 90% del tempo lo passo in cucina,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}preparando croissants, madeleines{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
e baguettes, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hast du mein Sofa schon gesehen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Dann hast du mein Lieblings-
plätzchen ja bereits entdeckt!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Da sitze ich gerne und lese,
stricke oder döse vor mich hin.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Probier's aus,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} ist echt bequem!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Daha denemediysen mutlaka {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
üstüne otur.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Şöyle yayılıp kitap okumak
için biçimi tam ideal.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}While I have you over,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} there's
something I'd like to show you.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}What do you think of my
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's not just a pet!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}I'm not very good at catching bugs,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
so {{TAG:0003:0025:}}I was hoping I'd get better after
living with one for a while.
I've already learned a lot from it,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du wüsstest sicher gerne, was ich
in {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0C006D00650069006E0065006D000C006D00650069006E00650072000C006D00650069006E0065006D00}} {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
aufbewahre, oder?
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Da drin ist so ein Durcheinander,
dass nicht mal ich selbst da noch
so genau durchsteige, hihi!{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

EN:
Inside that {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
is some curry I made the other day.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Is it starting to smell funky?!

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh yes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} garbage bins are so useful!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Instead of paying to get rid of my
trash,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}I can take care of it myself.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}What do you think of my place?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}It reflects my personality,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} doesn't
it, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Qué te parece mi casita?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Creo que refleja bastante bien
mi personalidad, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wie gefällt's dir denn bei mir?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Die Wohnung sagt viel über einen
aus,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} meinst du nicht?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi ci è voluto un po' per decidere{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
come arredare questo pied-à-terre.
{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Spero di aver fatto un buon lavoro!
